90s: How many minutes (min 0, max 90) did they play per game on average?
    Used to normalize stats
    Very slight bias given towards players with more playtime (arguable)
    Filter out players with < 3.5 mins per game on average

Name:
    Obviously not used when doing ranking, but for filtering
    If players have multiple name lists, means either:
      Played multiple positions --> Pick most defensive position
      Played for multiple teams/leagues --> Pick greater time played (90s)
      
    

Priorities:

High Positive
% Tackles Won
% Dribble Challenges Won
# Def 3rd Tackles
# Interceptions
# Shots Blocked
# Passes Blocked

High Negative
# Errors

Mid Positive
# Clearances
# Mid 3rd Tackles
# Dribble Challenges Total
# Shots + Passes Blocked (Combined)

Low Positive
# Att 3rd Tackles
% 90s
# Tackles + Interceptions
    
